<para>Uses the ratio of output dimensions, not the Wayland buffer DPR.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>native_output</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Output rectangle in the native coordinate space. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>native_area</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Work area in the same native coordinate space. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>logical_output</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Corresponding output rectangle in logical coordinates. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Clipped logical work area, or an empty rectangle for invalid geometry. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
