        <briefdescription>
<para>Read the logical work area for a named XWayland output. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a separate, read-only, process-lifetime XCB connection through DISPLAY. Call on the GUI thread. Missing DISPLAY, outputs or EWMH data are tolerated.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>output_name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Exact RandR output name to match. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>logical_output</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Output rectangle in logical coordinates. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Converted work area, or an empty rectangle when lookup fails. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
